{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.yinyue.2019b.q06.material.recovered", "text": "阅读材料，并回答问题。 楚老师在高一年级“音乐鉴赏”模块的教学中发现，来自本市一部分地区的学生音乐素质较好，看得出接受过较专业的音乐训练；而另一部分地区的学生则不甚理想，有些学生甚至连简谱都不认识，于是她决定将音乐课改为小组学习的形式，每个小组由音乐素养较好的和音乐素养-般的同学混合组成。同时为鼓励组员间的互相帮助，楚老师将期中、期末考核形式定为小组表演的形式为主，小组表演的总分数对本组组员的个人成绩有直接影响，以促进组员之间的积极互动与合作。34依据《普通高中音乐课程标准（实验）》基本理念，分析楚老师教学中的优点（", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019下半年教师资格考试《高中音乐》（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "b62c44f34b2a9329af1d4be72569cb191766f6c0d8ff03fc5da027c848430424", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2430, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2691, "next_source_question_number": 7, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019下半年教师资格考试《高中音乐》（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 6, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "b62c44f34b2a9329af1d4be72569cb191766f6c0d8ff03fc5da027c848430424"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.yinyue.2019b.q06"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.yinyue.s1.k05", "ntce.gaozhong.yinyue.s1.k08", "ntce.gaozhong.yinyue.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.design", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.412.r001", "ntce.outline.412.r002", "ntce.outline.412.r006", "ntce.outline.412.r008", "ntce.outline.412.r011"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.yinyue.2019b.q06"], "word_count": 261, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "yinyue", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019下半年教师资格考试《高中音乐》（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2019下半年教师资格考试《高中音乐》（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "b62c44f34b2a9329af1d4be72569cb191766f6c0d8ff03fc5da027c848430424", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2430, "decoded_csv_character_end": 2691, "next_source_question_number": 7, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with